  "result": "Perfect! All tests pass. I've added two functions for managing invoice lines:\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`**\n- Adds a new line at the end of the invoice\n- If the SKU already exists, merges by increasing the quantity\n- Validates: `NOT_DRAFT`, `QTY_INVALID`, `UNKNOWN_SKU`\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with complete line data from catalogue\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`**\n- Removes the line with the given SKU\n- Errors: `NOT_DRAFT`, `LINE_NOT_FOUND` (SKU not on invoice), `NO_LINES` (would remove last line)\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` without that line\n\n**Error codes added:**\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND`: No line with that SKU on the invoice\n- `NOT_DRAFT`: Can only modify invoices with status \"draft\"\n\n**Test coverage** (14 new tests):\n- Adding new and existing lines\n- Merging quantities correctly\n- All error cases\n- Immutability of input invoices\n- Combined add/remove workflows\n- Multiple sequential operations\n\nAll 51 tests pass (37 existing + 14 new).",
